# chat-vault-file's request for a file the person picks (sfpages decision.mbt vault_ask_card, settings vault_ask.mbt
# vault_foot): 选择文件 over 存入 (which waits for one), a file picked coming in beside it with nothing moving, 存入,
# then 已存入文件「生产集群」 in its place.
timeout 20000
until 选择文件
wait 800
picks prod-kubeconfig.yaml:5321
tap 选择文件
wait 900
tap =存入
until 已存入
wait 1200
